{"id":8840480,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/merge_requests/3857","number":3857,"state":"merged","title":"修复超32位切分","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/3857","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/3857/issues","body":"## 描述\n<!--在这里详细描述你的改动，包括改动的原因和所采取的方法。-->\nNormal算子，当输入超大shape用例触发超32K切分场景，aclnnInplaceNormal接口层npu由于对输入dtype进行了升精度到fp32计算，会提前切分逻辑，导致与竞品比精度失败\n同时，在修复升精度问题后，保持原dtype进入算子L0层计算，数据类型转换需对齐竞品，取消计算中的Mul、Add等api调用，直接独立kernel计算\n## 关联的Issue\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的Issue，请在这里提供Issue链接。-->\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的问题单，请在这里描述问题单单号。-->\nhttps://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/issues/2162\n## 测试\n<!--描述进行了哪些测试来验证你的改动。包括但不限于二级冒烟、算子泛化等。-->\n各泛化测试\n## 文档更新\n<!--如果这个PR包含文档的更新，请在这里指出。例如：更新了README.md文件。-->\n不涉及\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n\n\n","assignees_number":11,"assignees":[{"id":"6822d21660184036954b1468","login":"wangrui_","name":"RuiWang_","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wangrui_","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68777000fc42115893ad8b8c","login":"songkai111","name":"songkai111","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/songkai111","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"682accc0a6508e17e040cd22","login":"zhangzijie","name":"zhangzijie","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhangzijie","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6861e470543b5b4023533df4","login":"jia0liang","name":"陈佳良","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/jia0liang","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822dffae4b985165b4b112b","login":"loov1","name":"loov","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/loov1","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822d582053cff786c910efe","login":"rxtfeng","name":"rxtfeng","html_url":